        "jp": "ふたたび想いを響かせ合うことができましたね。\r\nビジョンの力を正しく使えると、信じていますよ……。",
        "official_en": "I see that you have once again resonated with their thoughts... I have the utmost faith you will wield this hero’s power with all the wisdom it is due.",
        "real_en": "You've managed to resonate with each other's feelings once more. I believe you'll use the power of Visions wisely..."
