        "jp": "英雄の物語を、ふたたび見つめなおしたいと\r\n願うなら……クリスタルに手を伸ばすのです。",
        "official_en": "If you desire to pay homage to the hero once more...place your hand upon the crystal.",
        "real_en": "If you wish to look back on the hero's story once more... reach out and touch the crystal."
