      "text": {
        "jp": "語りかけても、新たな力は得られませんが……\r\n異界の物語に、想いを馳せることはできます。",
        "official_en": "You shall find no new puissance. Yet, should you so will it, the sanctum shall once more weave the tale of a distant world.",
        "real_en": "Speaking to the hero again won't grant you any new power... But you can still reflect on the story of another world."
